**Assessment file:** [Week 04 Review](review.w4.md)

## Recommended Study Approach

1. Complete the pre-week diagnostic.
2. Review your topic-level results.
3. Study Days 16–20, focusing on weaker areas.
4. Complete the practical exercises in each lesson.
5. Take the end-of-week knowledge check.
6. Compare your diagnostic and post-check results.

**Remember:** The goal isn't simply to memorize networking terminology. It's to understand how networks behave so you can recognize when something goes wrong.

